Deploy a defensive emplacement around you, summoning 2 guardian turrets in adjacent tiles for [5, 6, 7, 8, 9 (TL1-5)] turns. Guardian turrets redirect [15%, 26%, 35%, 43%, 50% (TL1-5)] of all damage taken by other adjacent allies (other than fellow guardian turrets) to themselves, and each is armed with a powerful turret capable of firing piercing bullets.

Guardian Turrets gain [1.00, 2.00, 3.00, 4.00, 5.00 (TL1-5)] ranks in Steamgun Mastery based on your Hunker Down talent level.
